This work has been done with heavy LLM assitance.

This software was written with substantial help from a large language
model (LLM). I did the planning, the structuring and the verifying, and
wrote some of the code myself, but a large part of it was written by
the model.

Permission: To the extent that I hold any rights in this software,
including any I may hold in the parts written by the model, I allow
you to do whatever you like with it: copy, modify, publish, sell,
link, embed, you name it. I aim glad if you use it. The software is
provided "as is", without warranty of any kind, and I take no
responsibility for it.

Uncertainty: The law on works written by language models is still
unclear. A model is not a person and cannot be an author, so it is
possible that nobody holds rights in the parts it wrote.

Origin: Because of how these models are trained, some parts may
resemble or reproduce code protected by other people's copyrights.
That would be unintentional. If you find such a part, please report
it and I will fix or remove it.

